      <h2 class="profile-section-title" id="timeline-title">Timeline</h2>
      <ol class="rf-events"><li><span class="rf-year">1452</span><span class="rf-text">Leonardo is born in or close to Vinci in Tuscany, the son of the notary Ser Piero da Vinci and Caterina di Meo Lippi</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1472</span><span class="rf-text">At the age of 20 he qualifies as a master in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/guild">Guild</a> of Saint Luke in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/florence">Florence</a>, while continuing to work with Verrocchio</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1482</span><span class="rf-text">He leaves <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/florence">Florence</a> for <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/milan">Milan</a> and the court of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ludovico-sforza">Ludovico Sforza</a>, where he works until 1499</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1490s</span><span class="rf-text">He paints The Last Supper for the refectory of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/santa-maria-delle-grazie-milan">Santa Maria delle Grazie</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/milan">Milan</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1502</span><span class="rf-text">He enters the service of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cesare-borgia">Cesare Borgia</a> as military architect and engineer and draws a town plan of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/imola">Imola</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1503</span><span class="rf-text">Back in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/florence">Florence</a>, he begins a portrait of Lisa del Giocondo, the Mona Lisa, on which he works into his later years</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1516</span><span class="rf-text">He enters the service of King <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/francis-i">Francis I</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a> and is given the use of the manor house of Clos Lucé</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1519</span><span class="rf-text">Leonardo dies at Clos Lucé at the age of 67 and is buried at the Château d'Amboise</span></li></ol>
